WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.179
Mr. Ide, the suit is kind of lagging.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.347
Lagging?

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.891
The suit is operating normally.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:25.481
I think the time is about right, Ide.

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.403
All right.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:32.657
-Shinjiro.
-Mr. Ide?

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:35.243
I'm going to disengage the limiter
on the suit now.

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:36.703
Limiter?

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:41.708
Think of it as a way to bring out
your ultimate abilities.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.501
All right.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:47.213
However, when the limiter is disengaged,

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:49.549
you and the suit can only last
three minutes.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:56.014
So, the next time he comes at you
will be your last chance.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.225
Disengage the limiter!

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.374
You sure are tenacious.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.380
Wow! Isn't that

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.761
the danger signal that goes off
just before you fall apart?

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:36.805
No.

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:39.349
This isn't any danger signal.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.772
This is the signal for me
to use all my power...

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:48.316
to kick your ass.

00:01:55.031 --> 00:01:58.034
My left arm!

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.213
I won't stand for this.

